WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.473
What a strange place.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.021
Hey!

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.523
I finally found it.

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:25.525
How are you feeling?

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:27.986
Where are we?

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:30.780
First, let me thank you.

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:32.365
I'm Asbel of Pejite.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.617
Thank you for saving me.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.747
I'm Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.166
Where are we?

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:45.170
No wonder you're surprised.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:46.921
We're beneath the Sea of Decay.

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:49.007
Beneath the Sea of Decay?

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.967
Look, we fell from up there,

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:52.969
along with the sand.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.474
We're not wearing masks.

00:00:58.099 --> 00:01:01.227
That's right. The air here is pure.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.063
I couldn't believe it myself,

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:06.066
finding this place under the Sea of Decay.

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:13.990
What is it?

